libdovi (dovi_tool's dolby_vision crate, C API) 3.4.0
Source: https://github.com/quietvoid/dovi_tool/tree/libdovi-3.4.0
Prebuilt by https://github.com/superuser404notfound/LibDovi at tag 2.1.0 (see
Artifacts/Libdovi.README.md).

libdovi is a Rust static library, so it carries the crates it depends on and
the Rust standard library (toolchain 1.96.0). Each component below is used
under the MIT License, or under the MIT option of a dual licence, and the full
text follows once. memchr, tinyvec, miniz_oxide and adler2 are used under
their Unlicense, Zlib or 0BSD options, which ask for no notice in a binary;
they are listed for completeness.

